xmodel/sol-round6.md-3-## Five-line executive summary
xmodel/sol-round6.md-4-
xmodel/sol-round6.md-5-1. **DEFECT RULING:** $E_{29}\neq0$ forces the repaired candidate to use 30 inputs and 30 measured outputs with no free stream; withdraw `e=295` for that object, while retaining CYCLIC-30 as an all-depth gate.
