  1367	THE COMMISSIONED OBJECT. The 6 row22red compat rows reduce (8.S4 +
  1368	nf-quickshot) to NF_j = sum_k A_jk(x) tg_k + b_j(x), affine in the
  1369	4 level-44 tails (x17,x25,x32,x37) over the 22-var fiber ring. If
