Proposition 3 For any field k of characteristic p and any k-point v of
Spec R, the degree of fv (as an endomorphism of the Weyl algebra An,k ) is
equal to the degree of fvcentr (as an endomorphism of the polynomial algebra)
where fvcentr is the endomorphism of Center(An,k ) ≃ k[x1 , . . . , x2n ] induced
from fpcentr .

