xmodel/sol-approaches.md-9-This is an operationally complete map of the *top-level* proof and disproof programs I can identify. It deliberately includes overlapping formulations when the missing theorem is genuinely different, and includes bad routes when their failure teaches us something. It does not attempt to list every named lemma or every possible implementation of Gröbner elimination.
